    "section": "12. Fight Phase",
    "ruleNumber": "12.02",
    "summary": "Both players pile in with any eligible units they like, eligibility being set by the Eligible If section of the pile-in move. The player taking the turn finishes all of theirs first, then their opponent; there is no alternating, and no unit can pile in more than once in this step.",
